WEBVTT

00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:05.293
This video shows how to turn a confirmed enquiry into a student on a phone.

00:00:06.963 --> 00:00:18.579
Tap the menu button, open Admissions and choose Enquiries. Only Confirmed enquiries, counted as Ready to convert, can be converted, and their cards have a checkbox.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:36.920
Tap the checkbox on the Bilal Khan card. A dark bar appears at the top with the count and a Convert to students button.

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:49.517
Tap Convert to students. A window opens with Bilal Khan's name and asks for an academic year and a class and section.

00:00:49.981 --> 00:00:59.269
Choose the current academic year, then the class and section, Class 1 - A. Below, you can tick Auto-generate fee records, but we leave it off.

00:01:03.007 --> 00:01:13.111
Tap Convert 1 Enquiries. The student record and enrollment are created, and the funnel now shows 25% of enquiries converted.

00:01:23.759 --> 00:01:28.151
Bilal Khan is now a student, enrolled in Class 1 - A.
